<title>RUSSIA: ATHLETICS-BUBKA PULLS OUT OF TORONTO MEETING.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-BUBKA PULLS OUT OF TORONTO MEETING.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Injury has forced world pole vault record holder Sergei Bubka to pull out of Sunday's athletics meeting in Toronto at which Michael Johnson and Donovan Bailey clash over 150 metres.</p>
<p>The Russian daily Sport-Express reported that Bubka had a nagging Achilles tendon injury, the same problem which prevented him from competing at the Atlanta Olympics.</p>
</text>
